# App Store version of Arithmo Slayer that is public right now.
#
# App Store Connect closes a version train once that version is released. An
# upload that still carries the released MARKETING_VERSION is refused during the
# App Store Connect hand-off, after the archive and every export have succeeded.
# `tests/xcode-integration.test.mjs` therefore fails until MARKETING_VERSION in
# App/App.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj is greater than the version on the line
# below, so the Cloud post-clone hook stops a doomed build before it archives.
#
# Only the owner updates this file, and only after the new version is live.
1.0
